      "text": "Bit of startup advice which I rarely hear:\n\nSpend the money on a nice office.\n\nBe frugal on just about everything else, but get a nice office.\n\nIt's hard to appreciate just how much your office becomes a representation of your company. Plus, you're going to spend 10k+ hrs in it.",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1211856908493238272"
    },
