        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 1,
        "retweet_count": 4
      },
      "text": "Specialized knowledge economies should make you suspicious because it's hard to understand everything that's going on.\n\nSpecialization makes it easier to lie about your own &amp; your specialty's greatness.\n\nYou see this everywhere in academia today, where 75% of papers are garbage.",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1211663081878806528"
