      "text": "Fun stuff on xmas:\n\nThe creators of Cards Against Humanity (@CAH) have pivoted to a checkout + shipping platform, https://t.co/7LZV4oGIYU\n\nI wanted to see if they were using @stripe under the hood, and indeed they are! The error msg on 4242 4242 4242 4242 is a dead giveaway! https://t.co/DaoRqKFRuf",
