      "id": "1206372099452915712",
      "lang": "en",
      "possibly_sensitive": false,
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 40,
        "impression_count": 0,
        "like_count": 380,
        "quote_count": 3,
        "reply_count": 4,
        "retweet_count": 49
      },
      "text": "The reason you can do what people say is impossible is because the world is incredibly miscalibrated.\n\nPeople wildly underestimate how feasible it is to do something new. At the same time, they underestimate the difficulty of doing something again.\n\nDo not listen to other people.",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1206372099452915712"
    },
