      },
      "text": "The best companies demonstrate micro chaos and macro structure.\n\nMicro chaos (resembling anarchy) allows the interesting ideas to survive, and ultimately the best ideas to win.\n\nMacro structure offers predictability, accountability, and debuggability.",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1204881131574829058"
