        ],
        "text": "Bill on competitive inspiration:\n\n\"Our competition said, 'Windows had the risk of just becoming a set of poorly debugged device drivers.' That’s a direct quote, which is great, when your competition motivates you so eloquently. And it was true. That was an actual risk.\" 3/"
      },
