        "text": "Incredible quotes from @BillGates and @reidhoffman's @mastersofscale episode:\n\nMitch Lasky on Bill:\n\n“Bill is wrong. But he works so hard, he probably will succeed even though he’s wrong in this case.”\n\nHard work gives you the ability to bend the world in your direction. 1/"
